{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118509","id":3521690945,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7R6L1B","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118509","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118509.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118509.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118509","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118509/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118509/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118509/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/97b603e88e616ed8f1cbad9f4fbca97127c0f469","number":118509,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Rewrite RingBuffer","user":{"login":"Brogolem35","id":29329606,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MzI5NjA2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29329606?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brogolem35","html_url":"https://github.com/Brogolem35","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brogolem35/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brogolem35/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brogolem35/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brogolem35/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brogolem35/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brogolem35/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brogolem35/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brogolem35/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brogolem35/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR rewrites the RingBuffer.\r\nTested against #117449. Requires minor changes for the test to work.\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n- No longer depends on the LocalVector.\r\n- `RingBuffer` now owns its contents.\r\n- `read` no longer have a `p_advance` optional argument. Could not find any place where it was passed with anything other than `true`, which was the default anyway. Use `copy` instead.\r\n- Instead of using a read and a write head, a read head and a count variable is used, inferring the write head position from the count. This gets rid of the complicated calculation required to get the data left in the buffer. This also allows the buffer to use its full capacity, but an element is still left empty to not break existing code. That breakage can be done in another PR.\r\n- Fixes read and write heads pointing to invalid indexes when the buffer is resized to a smaller amount.\r\n\r\n## Benchmark\r\nCode from #117099 is used for benchmarking with `run_len` changed to 80000. No regression or improvement is observed. All differences are well within margin of error.\r\n\r\nResults (left new, right old):\r\n[bench.log](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/33194102/bench.log)\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":